  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なかなか止まないな\r\nさっきより激しくなってきたような……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020100,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……うーん……黙ってても何だし\r\n何か話を振ってみるか）",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "やっぱり上着を\r\n貸そうか？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "……なんか、\r\n誰もいないな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "select": "早く晴れてほしいよな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冷えてきたし……\r\n凛世に風邪はひかせられないよ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020110,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさま\r\n凛世も、同じ気持ちなのでございます",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020120,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世も、プロデューサーさまに\r\nお風邪をひいてほしくないのです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……そうか。凛世も俺を心配してくれていたのか）",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ありがとう、凛世",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020130,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世は、何も……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、なんていうか、\r\n凛世の言葉で、体もあたたまったって感じがするよ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020140,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "そのような……\r\nお役に立てたなら、うれしく思います",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020150,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "それに、凛世も……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020160,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "とてもあたたかいのです、\r\nプロデューサーさま",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020170,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや、べつに深い意味はないんだけど\r\nこんなに静かだと、みんなの声が聞きたくなるよなって",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020180,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい、ですが……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020190,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世と、プロデューサーさまが、\r\nこの世にふたりきりになったようで……素敵です",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　まあ……\r\nひとりなら寂しいけど、ふたりだから寂しくはないな",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020200,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは。\r\nよし、せっかくだしもう少し話そうか",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020210,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい、\r\nどのようなお話でも……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？\r\nじゃあ、このあいだ読んだ漫画の話なんだが……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020220,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……ふふ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020230,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさまは、そうなのですね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そりゃ、凛世に風邪をひかせたくないしな\r\n凛世は、晴れてほしくないのか？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020240,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさまが、お望みならば……\r\nですが……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……凛世は雨が好きなのかな？）",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんにしても、このままだと風邪ひき確定だ\r\n凛世、もう少し近くに寄ってくれないか？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020250,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……！\r\nよろしいの、でしょうか……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………ち、ちょっと近すぎる……かな……？\r\nもうちょっと、距離感があってもいいんじゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020260,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……ご迷惑、でしたでしょうか……\r\n申し訳ございません……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "い、いや……\r\n凛世がいいならべつにいいんだけど……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020270,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "お許しいただけるならば……\r\n凛世は、このまま……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020280,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……このまま、\r\n雨が、上がらなければよいと、思うのです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200302/2012003020280"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
